ears a fixed-margin null, is team-persistent across split halves, and is not collinear with play-type rates (pilot).", "observed_result": "C1 8/8 p<0.05; C2 S=0.319 within=43.027 between=134.770 perm_p=0.0002 (cosine S=0.154); C3 R2=0.080", "auto_failure_mechanism": "D_positive (no failure: positive result)", "observed_failure_evidence": "all three gate criteria passed", "observed_sample_and_power": "8 team-seasons pilot", "auto_validation_status": "same_pipeline_validation; evidence: PAP-001: '8 frozen pilot team-seasons, odd/even game split, min-overlap associ'", "observed_method": "8 frozen pilot team-seasons, odd/even game split, min-overlap association standardized vs 1000 fixed-margin shuffles; 3 gate criteria.", "observed_verdict": "supported", "observed_failure_type": "D_positive"}, "relationships": []}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-005", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-005: Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)", "score": 0.455, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-CHT-052 auto_related_family (limitation_precedent) FAM:SF-APPA-005", "request matches DS:Play_type_initiation_records_Neo4j_INITIATED_edges_play_type_possessions (0.66); FAM:SF-APPA-005 auto_uses_dataset DS:Play_type_initiation_records_Neo4j_INITIATED_edges_play_type_possessions"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Defensive scheme change within game and across games (inferred labels)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Playoff defenses change scheme within games and between games, especially after the opponent ran a play type heavily.", "observed_result": "Within-game change 319/523 (61.0%); cross-game change 298/440 (67.7%); 103/104 units (99.0%) and 52/52 series show a change; transition matrices near-uniform.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Doc caveat: inferred label cannot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.", "observed_sample_and_power": "523 cells; 440 pairs", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-032", "label": "Study family SF-CHT-032: Teammate DRIVE then PNR including calibrated labels then inferrer-only", "score": 0.455, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-CHT-052 auto_related_family (limitation_precedent) FAM:SF-CHT-032", "request matches DS:Play_type_initiation_records_Neo4j_INITIATED_edges_play_type_possessions (0.66); FAM:SF-CHT-032 auto_uses_dataset DS:Play_type_initiation_records_Neo4j_INITIATED_edges_play_type_possessions"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Teammate DRIVE then PNR including calibrated labels then inferrer-only", "auto_outcome_status": "artifact", "observed_hypothesis": "Any teammate DRIVE preceding a PNR raises PNR PPP.", "observed_result": "League-wide including calibrated PNR: +0.022 PPP, p=0.004 (n=20,658 vs 159,623). Tatum +0.152 p=0.27. Inferrer-only DRIVE-PNR ATT=-0.006, p=0.76.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)", "observed_failure_evidence": "The +0.022 vanished to -0.006 once PNR was inferrer-only; calibrated-PNR temporal contamination.", "observed_sample_and_power": "n~180k including calibrated labels", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "artifact_found", "observed_failure_type": "C_artifact"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-005"}]}], "n_results": 10}

